# vocab.txt.example — the words the ear should expect to hear.
#
# Copy to `$YMIR_HOME/config/skirnir/vocab.txt`. One term per line; `#` starts a comment and blank
# lines are ignored. This is a hint for the speech recogniser, never a private fact: put in it the
# names a general model has never seen — your clients, your companies, your products, your trade's
# nouns.
#
# WHY IT LIVES IN THE HOME (plan 288 §1, RULES/42): a client's name is personal data, and a public
# repository that lists it publishes it to every clone. The repository ships only the house's own
# names as its default.
#
# Read by:  systems/skirnir/services/ear.sh

Acme
Harbour
ventilation inspection
